  "about": "I’m a software engineer and technical lead with experience building full-stack applications, enterprise software, ERP systems, integrations, and data-driven tools.\n\nMy work spans software architecture, application development, database design, systems integration, and business process automation. I enjoy taking complex technical or operational problems and turning them into reliable, maintainable software.\n\nI also have a strong interest in mathematics, research, simulation, analytics, and computational methods. I’m especially drawn to technically demanding projects involving mathematical modeling, complex systems, data analysis, optimization, and opportunities to experiment with new approaches.\n\nMy experience includes .NET, C#, ASP.NET, SQL, React, TypeScript, JavaScript, WinForms, WPF, MAUI, Visual Studio, REST APIs, database development, and full-stack software development.\n\nI’m particularly interested in opportunities involving technical leadership, enterprise applications, analytics, healthcare technology, health informatics, applied mathematics, simulation, or other complex systems where software and data can be used to solve meaningful problems.",
